{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項可能引起數學界巨大震動的消息近日出現：Anthropic數學家Levent Alpöge聲稱，他在人工智能模型Claude的協助下，找到了黎曼猜想的證明，並進一步聲稱解決了範圍更廣的廣義黎曼猜想（Generalized Riemann Hypothesis，GRH）。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587306.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:24:27.089401+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:12:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.765399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.765399+00:00","content_hash":"1dd0e7ef345fc4fee04e9c1aa4085e5f80c5ae024783776f55bf4b7ad10363a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}